            <ArticleTitle>Cervical spinal abscess: an insidious presentation and unusual pathology.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e184-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1308/003588412X13373405384693</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spinal abscess is a rare condition. Its presentation can often be subtle and insidious. This report describes the diagnosis and management of an 87-year-old man who presented to our orthopaedic clinic. We would like to emphasise the importance of rapid diagnosis and prompt treatment in such cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
